WEBVTT

01:36.580 --> 01:41.009
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.370 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 20]

01:49.509 --> 01:51.240
A broken sword can be reforged.

01:52.310 --> 01:54.310
A withered flower will bloom again.

01:56.200 --> 01:57.860
Even if the body is destroyed,

02:00.400 --> 02:01.860
it's just a new beginning.

02:03.230 --> 02:04.960
A broken sword can be reforged.

02:05.000 --> 02:07.000
A withered flower will bloom again.

02:07.070 --> 02:09.100
Son, remember this:

02:10.240 --> 02:12.240
even if you're shattered to pieces,

02:12.870 --> 02:15.240
it's merely a chance to start anew.

02:45.020 --> 02:46.530
To learn and practice constantly,

02:46.530 --> 02:47.790
is that not a pleasure?

02:47.960 --> 02:49.520
To have friends come from afar,

02:49.520 --> 02:50.720
is that not a delight?

02:50.910 --> 02:52.240
To stay unbothered when misunderstood,

02:52.240 --> 02:53.430
isn't that noble?

02:53.680 --> 02:54.280
Applause.

02:56.840 --> 02:57.520
Qiushui.

02:58.190 --> 02:59.320
From today onwards,

02:59.560 --> 03:03.590
your brother will teach you
the Huanhua Sword Technique for me.

03:04.310 --> 03:05.440
You must study hard.

03:09.560 --> 03:10.150
Xilou,

03:10.520 --> 03:13.590
do you think Qiushui
has a talent for martial arts?

03:14.230 --> 03:16.140
He's my son after all.

03:17.079 --> 03:19.829
He'll be just like Yiren someday.

03:52.630 --> 03:53.280
Qiushui,

03:53.680 --> 03:54.410
take a break.

03:54.520 --> 03:56.980
I made your favorite noodles.
Come quickly.

03:57.190 --> 03:57.750
Mother.

03:57.950 --> 03:59.680
Let me wipe your sweat. Come on.

04:01.030 --> 04:02.000
Come on, eat up.

04:04.310 --> 04:05.310
Be careful. It's hot.

04:05.310 --> 04:06.910
No one's fighting you for it.

04:07.590 --> 04:08.990
Mother, it's delicious.

04:10.120 --> 04:11.780
If you like it, have some more.

04:11.910 --> 04:12.400
Well,

04:12.430 --> 04:15.290
want me to roll the noodles
into a drumstick for you?

04:15.590 --> 04:17.240
Let me roll a noodle drumstick for you.

04:17.240 --> 04:18.920
A big one.

04:22.040 --> 04:23.300
Open your mouth. Here.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.070
Good boy!

04:27.680 --> 04:28.720
Eat the egg too.

04:29.310 --> 04:29.830
Okay.

04:32.560 --> 04:33.270
Qiushui.

04:36.390 --> 04:37.270
Take a break.

04:38.920 --> 04:39.600
Qiushui,

04:40.720 --> 04:42.680
a sword is a gentleman's weapon.

04:43.070 --> 04:45.600
Swordsmanship isn't just about techniques.

04:45.800 --> 04:47.530
You must put your heart into it.

04:47.800 --> 04:48.400
Remember,

04:49.240 --> 04:50.830
the sword in your hand

04:51.240 --> 04:53.920
represents our Xiao family.

04:54.630 --> 04:56.750
No matter where you go in the future,

04:57.390 --> 05:01.520
you must make the Huanhua Sword Technique
renowned throughout the world.

05:01.750 --> 05:02.810
Do you understand?

05:03.600 --> 05:04.730
I'll keep it in mind.

05:10.800 --> 05:12.000
Ancestors above,

05:12.360 --> 05:14.040
Xiao Kaiyan, Xiao Yiren,
Xiao Qiushui, and Xiao Xueyu

05:14.040 --> 05:15.170
make this vow today.

05:15.630 --> 05:17.810
We'll carry on
our parents' lofty ambitions,

05:17.810 --> 05:20.040
wield our swords
for justice in the martial world,

05:20.040 --> 05:22.480
keep our family
and the country in our hearts,

05:22.480 --> 05:25.140
and fail neither ourselves
nor the ones we love.

05:59.510 --> 06:00.630
I remember now.

06:02.710 --> 06:04.000
I remember now.

06:07.210 --> 06:07.770
Father,

06:09.190 --> 06:09.920
Mother,

06:11.240 --> 06:11.950
Yiren,

06:13.240 --> 06:13.830
Kaiyan,

06:15.920 --> 06:16.830
and Xueyu.

06:21.040 --> 06:22.310
I remember now.

06:23.160 --> 06:24.630
I finally remember.

06:29.680 --> 06:30.340
Wonderful.

06:31.560 --> 06:33.420
With the Changge Sword's return,

06:34.190 --> 06:35.720
the Huanhua Sect is reborn.

06:36.830 --> 06:37.630
Xiao Qiushui.

06:38.530 --> 06:41.330
You are now the new sect leader
of the Huanhua Sect.

06:41.990 --> 06:42.750
Only you

06:43.510 --> 06:45.720
have recovered,
one by one, all the broken swords

06:45.720 --> 06:47.580
of the Huanhua Sect's disciples.

06:49.000 --> 06:52.190
This is the true meaning
of reforging broken swords.

06:57.000 --> 06:57.950
I, Xiao Qiushui,

06:59.270 --> 07:01.470
will not fail the trust of my ancestors.

07:02.190 --> 07:03.450
Don't worry, Qiushui.

07:03.950 --> 07:05.350
I'll continue to help you

07:05.800 --> 07:07.860
find a way to restore your meridians.

07:13.190 --> 07:14.050
Your Highness,

07:15.430 --> 07:16.160
I have no way

07:18.310 --> 07:19.640
to repay your kindness.

07:20.640 --> 07:21.170
Qiushui.

07:34.600 --> 07:37.700
[Tang Sect]

07:44.510 --> 07:45.070
Father,

07:45.560 --> 07:46.390
I'm back.

07:47.390 --> 07:48.600
Fang is back.

07:50.560 --> 07:52.420
I'm glad you've returned safely.

07:54.390 --> 07:55.040
Father,

07:55.800 --> 07:59.159
I've come back this time
to ask for your help with something.

08:00.360 --> 08:01.950
What is it? Tell me.

08:09.600 --> 08:10.930
If someone's meridians

08:11.350 --> 08:15.150
were shattered

08:15.170 --> 08:16.630
by Qu Hanshan's palm strike

08:16.630 --> 08:19.000
and then further twisted

08:19.000 --> 08:20.720
by the clash of the purest yin

08:21.310 --> 08:23.720
and yang internal energies in the world,

08:24.310 --> 08:27.120
do you think there's a cure for him?

08:32.429 --> 08:36.150
The only one who can save Xiao Qiushui now

08:36.840 --> 08:38.320
is Grand Master Dayin.

08:40.630 --> 08:43.360
Father, how do you know
I'm talking about him?

08:45.680 --> 08:46.950
Prince Liang has been

08:47.240 --> 08:49.790
sending out notices seeking medical help.

08:50.320 --> 08:52.850
Everyone in the martial world
knows about it,

08:53.030 --> 08:54.910
let alone me.

08:56.360 --> 08:57.030
But

08:57.720 --> 08:59.180
why do you want to save him?

09:07.600 --> 09:08.720
He's my friend,

09:09.800 --> 09:12.800
and he was Tang Rou's closest friend
when he was alive.

09:19.360 --> 09:20.200
My dear Fang,

09:22.270 --> 09:25.440
I know what you're thinking.

09:26.030 --> 09:26.630
But

09:27.390 --> 09:29.840
do you know who injured him so badly?

09:32.390 --> 09:33.120
Liu Suifeng.

09:33.670 --> 09:36.330
As the eldest son
of the Tang Sect's main branch,

09:36.790 --> 09:39.550
he has now become
the Deputy Chief of the Power Gang

09:39.550 --> 09:41.510
and a menace to the martial world.

09:43.510 --> 09:44.080
Father,

09:45.280 --> 09:46.680
you already knew?

09:47.270 --> 09:48.330
Then why didn't you

09:48.480 --> 09:50.610
keep Feng in the main branch back then?

09:50.720 --> 09:51.960
He could have grown up

09:52.200 --> 09:53.800
in the Tang Sect just like me.

09:58.320 --> 10:02.360
Back then, I wanted
to protect him and his mother.

10:04.440 --> 10:07.600
But you know the rules of the Tang Sect.

10:10.030 --> 10:14.550
Marriage with outsiders
is strictly forbidden.

10:16.870 --> 10:17.670
Back then,

10:19.000 --> 10:21.360
to make our family
the main branch of the Tang Sect,

10:21.360 --> 10:22.750
I had no choice

10:23.200 --> 10:24.710
but to cut ties with them.

10:27.790 --> 10:30.510
Now the Tang Sect's Yinhai Night
is approaching.

10:30.510 --> 10:31.790
I never expected

10:33.360 --> 10:36.630
you'd face the same dilemma I once did.

10:37.840 --> 10:39.170
Is being the main branch

10:40.810 --> 10:42.140
really that important?

10:43.720 --> 10:45.380
If we weren't the main branch,

10:45.630 --> 10:47.200
Old Madam Tang would've forced you

10:47.200 --> 10:48.730
to marry Tang Song long ago.

10:50.440 --> 10:51.030
Fang,

10:51.720 --> 10:54.480
you now understand what's at stake.

10:54.840 --> 10:56.640
As for your friend Xiao Qiushui,

10:57.010 --> 10:59.670
whether you continue
your association with him

11:00.750 --> 11:02.150
is your decision to make.

11:09.720 --> 11:10.980
I understand, Father.

11:11.750 --> 11:15.000
But I must save Xiao Qiushui.

11:18.440 --> 11:19.150
Fine.

11:20.750 --> 11:22.030
Grand Master Dayin

11:22.830 --> 11:24.890
lives in the nearby Biechuan Temple.

11:25.230 --> 11:27.960
Tell your friend to seek him out.

11:33.220 --> 11:34.280
Thank you, Father.

11:34.720 --> 11:37.380
I won't sneak out
without permission this time.

11:37.390 --> 11:40.450
I'll just send the message
to Prince Liang's quarters.

11:40.910 --> 11:41.480
Okay.

11:42.000 --> 11:42.750
Go now.

12:05.630 --> 12:07.490
Everything in this world is real.

12:08.030 --> 12:11.030
Xiao Mingming and Xiao Qiushui
both truly exist.

12:11.680 --> 12:14.680
I, Xiao Mingming, am Xiao Qiushui
of the Huanhua Sect.

12:15.550 --> 12:17.350
Could it be the Magic Code System

12:18.000 --> 12:20.960
that caused the timelines
of two worlds to intersect,

12:20.960 --> 12:22.910
giving us shared memories?

12:23.600 --> 12:25.270
In that world's system,

12:25.270 --> 12:28.510
I placed the "Voidheart Codex"
in the Sword Tomb.

12:30.910 --> 12:31.840
Could it be...

13:22.630 --> 13:23.270
Strange.

13:24.360 --> 13:25.240
Why are

13:26.750 --> 13:28.480
all the words here crossed out?

14:59.670 --> 15:01.800
"Behold the divine token of mystery."

15:01.880 --> 15:03.940
"All heroes shall bow immediately."

15:04.550 --> 15:05.550
The divine token?

15:08.550 --> 15:09.750
Three fingerprints.

15:10.670 --> 15:15.030
These 3 fingerprints
belong to the 3 grandmasters:

15:15.320 --> 15:17.440
Tianzheng, Taichan, and Zhichen.

15:18.080 --> 15:21.320
Could this be the true Hero Command Token?

15:22.150 --> 15:23.030
Rumor has it

15:23.030 --> 15:25.600
that the "Voidheart Codex" is
inside the Hero Command Token.

15:25.600 --> 15:27.530
But how exactly do I use this thing?

15:28.200 --> 15:30.150
Could it be hidden as a clue,

15:30.960 --> 15:32.420
waiting for me to uncover?

15:32.870 --> 15:34.150
Forget it for now.

15:34.480 --> 15:35.940
I'll think about it later.

15:43.200 --> 15:43.930
Big Brother.

15:44.360 --> 15:45.090
Big Brother.

15:46.200 --> 15:47.270
I've been looking everywhere for you.

15:47.270 --> 15:48.240
So you're here in the back mountain.

15:48.240 --> 15:49.200
What's the matter?

15:49.200 --> 15:50.060
It's good news.

15:50.200 --> 15:52.390
Miss Tang sent a message
by carrier pigeon.

15:52.390 --> 15:53.790
She says she's found a way to restore

15:53.790 --> 15:54.720
your meridians.

15:56.160 --> 15:57.980
[Grand Master Dayin, Biechuan Temple]

15:57.390 --> 15:58.120
Big Brother,

15:58.290 --> 15:59.200
I knew there was a way

15:59.200 --> 16:00.460
to heal your injuries.

16:02.870 --> 16:03.400
Let's go.

16:26.870 --> 16:27.960
Master, you were injured by Xiao Qiushui's

16:27.960 --> 16:29.910
internal energy
from the Shaolin and Wudang Sects.

16:29.910 --> 16:31.720
Circulating your qi
can make it better for now,

16:31.720 --> 16:33.650
but it's not a long-term solution.

16:34.600 --> 16:35.960
I'll go get the Herbal King.

16:35.960 --> 16:37.080
Just do your job.

16:40.510 --> 16:41.870
Don't act on your own.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.150
Go do it now.

17:02.480 --> 17:03.960
Master, you haven't fully recovered.

17:03.960 --> 17:05.030
Please be careful.

17:05.640 --> 17:06.200
Go.

17:12.000 --> 17:12.730
Liu Suifeng!

17:18.880 --> 17:20.400
You've violated the gang rules

17:20.400 --> 17:22.200
and injured 3 demonic fighters.

17:22.589 --> 17:24.720
Are you trying to rebel against Chief?

17:25.240 --> 17:28.069
I was acting on Chief's orders.

17:28.790 --> 17:30.390
How could that be rebellion?

17:30.830 --> 17:31.790
At Xiao's Sword Manor,

17:31.790 --> 17:34.160
you killed the sect leaders
of both Shaolin and Wudang.

17:34.160 --> 17:35.270
Do you know how much trouble

17:35.270 --> 17:37.270
you've brought upon the Power Gang?

17:37.510 --> 17:39.270
I was following orders.

17:39.480 --> 17:41.010
Following orders, you say?

17:42.400 --> 17:44.030
Look at this.

17:45.480 --> 17:46.400
Chief's token?

17:47.000 --> 17:50.000
By Chief's order,
you are to be arrested, Liu Suifeng.

17:50.720 --> 17:52.180
If you've got any excuses,

17:52.440 --> 17:53.990
save them for Chief later.

17:54.270 --> 17:54.920
Guards!

17:55.140 --> 17:56.070
No need for that.

17:59.030 --> 18:00.690
If Chief truly wants to see me,

18:01.100 --> 18:02.140
I'll go by myself.

18:40.310 --> 18:40.960
Chief,

18:41.400 --> 18:43.510
I've brought Liu Suifeng as ordered.

18:45.310 --> 18:45.720
Good.

18:47.160 --> 18:47.790
Hanshan,

18:48.720 --> 18:49.720
you may leave now.

18:50.000 --> 18:52.160
Chief, Liu Suifeng
harbors rebellious thoughts.

18:52.160 --> 18:53.490
I fear he might harm you.

18:54.370 --> 18:56.570
He won't. Go.

19:01.040 --> 19:01.680
Yes.

19:08.110 --> 19:10.310
Suifeng, come here.

19:18.030 --> 19:18.680
Suifeng.

19:20.120 --> 19:21.850
Do you remember this painting?

19:27.030 --> 19:29.070
When the Power Gang was first founded,

19:29.070 --> 19:31.070
you got the 7 of us brothers together

19:31.240 --> 19:33.370
to paint this "Mountains After Snow."

19:34.480 --> 19:36.010
When we drew this painting,

19:36.030 --> 19:37.310
the 7 of us were each

19:38.160 --> 19:40.200
supposed to paint a peak.

19:41.350 --> 19:42.550
But you refused,

19:43.230 --> 19:45.230
saying you'd only paint pine trees.

19:46.160 --> 19:50.110
So there are only 6 peaks
in this painting.

19:51.680 --> 19:52.810
Back then, the 7 of us

19:53.750 --> 19:56.720
fought countless battles
in founding the Power Gang.

19:56.720 --> 19:58.050
Only you and I survived.

19:58.710 --> 20:00.770
Your martial skills are impressive.

20:01.070 --> 20:03.870
Having you paint just pine trees
was an injustice.

20:05.200 --> 20:09.310
If there were to be
a highest peak in this painting,

20:09.960 --> 20:11.490
you'd be the one to paint it.

20:12.150 --> 20:12.740
Chief,

20:13.480 --> 20:15.740
I only wish to serve you
until my last day.

20:15.890 --> 20:17.550
I'd never overstep my bounds.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.140
Tianzheng and Taichan

20:32.020 --> 20:34.020
were 2 legends of the martial world.

20:34.510 --> 20:37.840
One must observe
proper formalities even just to meet them.

20:38.430 --> 20:39.260
But you,

20:40.170 --> 20:41.900
you killed them just like that,

20:47.920 --> 20:49.450
forcing Shaolin and Wudang

20:50.080 --> 20:52.410
to become the Power Gang's sworn enemies.

20:52.820 --> 20:54.010
If it weren't for you,

20:54.010 --> 20:57.010
White Phoenix wouldn't have been
exposed and killed.

20:58.200 --> 20:59.750
Since you're so capable,

21:00.270 --> 21:02.960
why do you humble yourself before me?

21:03.440 --> 21:05.700
I killed Tianzheng and Taichan because…

21:06.070 --> 21:07.480
I just received a secret report.

21:07.480 --> 21:11.160
The sect leaders of Shaolin and Wudang
have rushed to the Xiao Residence.

21:11.160 --> 21:12.270
Go stop them.

21:13.270 --> 21:14.440
End their lives.

21:16.830 --> 21:19.880
Someone impersonated me
and ordered you to kill them?

21:23.270 --> 21:23.960
Yes.

21:24.800 --> 21:26.500
I failed to retrieve
the Hero Command Token in time

21:26.500 --> 21:27.760
and disappointed you.

21:27.920 --> 21:29.650
I was desperate to make amends.

21:30.000 --> 21:32.680
B-But I never imagined

21:33.200 --> 21:34.920
someone could impersonate you

21:34.920 --> 21:36.030
so perfectly.

21:38.310 --> 21:39.770
One can always be outdone.

21:40.480 --> 21:42.880
If you had the ability
to kill Tianzheng and Taichan,

21:42.880 --> 21:45.110
someone else had the ability to fool you.

21:45.110 --> 21:47.030
You have my undying loyalty, Chief.

21:47.030 --> 21:47.910
I never dared

21:48.510 --> 21:49.910
to question your orders.

21:50.550 --> 21:52.720
I never thought I'd be used like this.

21:54.310 --> 21:57.350
But I never acted on my own or intended

21:58.720 --> 21:59.920
to rebel against you.

22:01.880 --> 22:03.000
I already said—

22:04.160 --> 22:05.290
you wouldn't rebel.

22:05.890 --> 22:07.160
What disappoints me is

22:09.720 --> 22:12.440
that everything is falling apart now.

22:14.200 --> 22:14.920
Suifeng.

22:15.840 --> 22:17.840
How many years have you followed me?

22:18.480 --> 22:19.350
Fifteen years.

22:22.550 --> 22:23.640
Fifteen years.

22:25.310 --> 22:27.570
Even if that guy's disguise was perfect,

22:28.160 --> 22:29.360
you should have known

22:30.000 --> 22:32.240
I'd never give such an order.

22:33.700 --> 22:35.630
Was his disguise really that good,

22:36.110 --> 22:38.200
or have you grown so overconfident

22:38.790 --> 22:40.250
that you became careless?

22:45.480 --> 22:48.550
People say that the Power Gang

22:48.920 --> 22:51.680
rules the martial world
and does whatever it pleases.

22:51.680 --> 22:53.140
You've heard this so often

22:53.310 --> 22:54.570
that you've forgotten

22:55.070 --> 22:58.920
why we established this gang
in the first place.

23:00.720 --> 23:01.720
I dare not forget.

23:03.110 --> 23:05.720
I know my mistake is unforgivable.

23:06.550 --> 23:07.950
Please punish me, Chief.

23:09.440 --> 23:10.160
Get up.

23:19.740 --> 23:21.400
After the coming palm strike,

23:21.840 --> 23:23.440
whether you live or die,

23:24.590 --> 23:28.790
you will no longer be
part of the Power Gang.

24:04.250 --> 24:04.980
Big Brother.

24:05.000 --> 24:05.730
Big Brother.

24:07.740 --> 24:08.600
Your Highness.

24:08.750 --> 24:10.310
I've decided to set off right now

24:10.310 --> 24:12.350
to Biechuan Temple
to find Grand Master Dayin.

24:12.350 --> 24:14.030
When Miss Tang sent the message,

24:14.030 --> 24:15.960
I thought you should set off early.

24:16.230 --> 24:18.590
But that place isn't safe right now.

24:20.920 --> 24:22.240
I heard on my way here

24:22.960 --> 24:25.160
that Zhu the Great King and the Power Gang

24:25.160 --> 24:27.420
have come to blows near Yunxia Mountain.

24:28.590 --> 24:29.920
How dare Zhu the Great King

24:29.920 --> 24:31.440
challenge the Power Gang?

24:35.030 --> 24:36.360
His influence used to be

24:36.440 --> 24:38.640
limited to the waterways on Long River.

24:38.750 --> 24:40.810
But the Power Gang has too many rules.

24:40.830 --> 24:42.920
And with the Hero Command Token incident,

24:42.920 --> 24:45.270
they made enemies
with both Wudang and Shaolin,

24:45.270 --> 24:47.480
so Zhu the Great King
seized the opportunity to win people over.

24:47.480 --> 24:49.920
Those lone fighters who dislike rules

24:50.030 --> 24:51.510
and enemies of the Power Gang

24:51.510 --> 24:52.970
have all joined his ranks.

24:53.640 --> 24:55.750
Many territories of the Power Gang

24:56.160 --> 24:58.720
now belong to Zhu the Great King.

25:00.400 --> 25:01.260
Your Highness,

25:02.200 --> 25:04.530
do you know about a man
called Shao Liulei?

25:04.750 --> 25:07.150
Years ago in the battle
at Wuxing Mountain,

25:07.590 --> 25:09.790
he was Zhu the Great King's subordinate

25:09.790 --> 25:12.240
but betrayed him during the chaos.

25:12.350 --> 25:13.810
He helped Crazy Yan escape

25:14.440 --> 25:16.700
and disappeared with him for many years.

25:18.680 --> 25:20.540
This conflict at Yunxia Mountain

25:20.550 --> 25:22.200
is likely connected to him.

25:25.480 --> 25:26.480
You mean

25:27.640 --> 25:29.640
Zhu the Great King and the Power Gang

25:30.270 --> 25:33.270
want more than just Shao Liulei
and the Infinite Pill;

25:33.750 --> 25:36.880
they want clues about Crazy Yan more.

25:37.920 --> 25:38.510
Exactly.

25:40.880 --> 25:41.440
Okay.

25:42.200 --> 25:43.400
Then I should hurry up

25:43.440 --> 25:45.070
and rescue

25:45.640 --> 25:47.640
Grand Master Dayin from this chaos.

25:48.110 --> 25:48.840
Big Brother.

25:48.960 --> 25:49.890
I'll go with you.

25:50.240 --> 25:52.400
There are many maze formations
around Biechuan Temple.

25:52.400 --> 25:54.480
I learned some formation techniques
at the Hailin Sect.

25:54.480 --> 25:55.280
I can help you.

25:55.310 --> 25:55.790
Okay.

25:56.720 --> 25:58.350
Fewer people will draw less attention.

25:58.350 --> 25:59.480
Qiu, you stay here

25:59.480 --> 26:00.720
and wait for our good news.

26:00.720 --> 26:01.720
Yes, Big Brother.

26:02.200 --> 26:02.830
Farewell.

26:02.960 --> 26:03.820
Wait, Qiushui.

26:04.480 --> 26:06.920
Biechuan Temple
doesn't receive ordinary visitors.

26:06.920 --> 26:10.160
Give this letter of introduction
to the monk who receives you.

26:10.160 --> 26:11.490
He will lead you inside.

26:11.540 --> 26:14.320
[From Liang Dou]

26:11.830 --> 26:12.960
I'm leaving at once.

26:13.310 --> 26:14.720
With the martial world in such chaos,

26:14.720 --> 26:17.270
all sects must unite to face it.

26:19.680 --> 26:21.140
Thank you, Your Highness.

26:22.030 --> 26:22.680
Take care.

26:25.550 --> 26:26.120
Let's go.

26:52.110 --> 26:53.500
Chief wants you to go back.

26:53.500 --> 26:54.960
Don't kneel here anymore.

26:57.720 --> 26:58.410
Blade King,

27:00.680 --> 27:02.440
please let me see Chief.

27:03.110 --> 27:05.880
You know Chief ordered me
to enforce the gang rules.

27:05.880 --> 27:07.590
Though I have the Misery Pill,

27:08.110 --> 27:09.840
with the blade in my hand alone,

27:10.160 --> 27:12.590
I can still kill you effortlessly.

27:13.480 --> 27:15.340
I only want one meeting with Chief

27:16.200 --> 27:17.730
to beg for his forgiveness.

27:21.640 --> 27:22.300
Blade King.

27:23.280 --> 27:24.080
You may leave.

27:24.130 --> 27:24.650
Yes.

27:28.720 --> 27:29.350
Suifeng.

27:30.170 --> 27:30.930
Get up.

27:32.530 --> 27:33.310
Shirong.

27:35.200 --> 27:36.200
I know I was wrong.

27:37.310 --> 27:40.720
Please speak to Chief on my behalf.

27:43.490 --> 27:45.620
Your mistake this time is too serious.

27:46.000 --> 27:47.400
There's nothing I can do.

27:47.880 --> 27:49.810
I know my mistake is unforgivable.

27:50.200 --> 27:52.200
I'm not trying to avoid punishment.

27:52.840 --> 27:54.770
I just want Chief to grant me death.

27:56.920 --> 27:59.850
It's better than being expelled
from the Power Gang.

27:59.960 --> 28:01.360
Why do you have to do this?

28:02.160 --> 28:05.270
This life of mine was given by Chief.

28:06.590 --> 28:07.920
If he no longer wants me,

28:10.120 --> 28:12.710
what's the point of me staying alive?

28:14.070 --> 28:16.230
If you're willing to die for Chief,

28:16.880 --> 28:19.010
why do you have to get his forgiveness?

28:20.360 --> 28:21.200
Shirong.

28:27.270 --> 28:27.960
Suifeng.

28:28.790 --> 28:29.720
You need to wait,

28:30.390 --> 28:31.720
not for forgiveness,

28:32.560 --> 28:33.890
but for an opportunity.

28:47.510 --> 28:48.240
Big Brother,

28:49.000 --> 28:50.800
is Grand Master Dayin in danger?

28:52.360 --> 28:54.360
If Shao Liulei is truly hiding here,

28:54.720 --> 28:57.030
there will surely be
powerful fighters around.

28:57.030 --> 28:58.560
We need to be careful today.

29:00.680 --> 29:01.210
Let's go.

29:25.530 --> 29:26.160
Watch out!

29:35.960 --> 29:37.750
This is a sacred Buddhist place.

29:37.750 --> 29:40.720
How dare you intrude
so rudely again and again?

29:42.550 --> 29:43.930
Go away. Leave!

29:43.960 --> 29:44.650
Sir,

29:44.960 --> 29:46.320
I apologize for offending you.

29:46.320 --> 29:47.510
I've come here

29:47.550 --> 29:49.750
to ask Grand Master Dayin for help.

29:50.240 --> 29:52.100
Please inform him of our arrival.

30:03.680 --> 30:06.990
Liang Dou sent you to me
for meridian treatment?

30:05.490 --> 30:06.830
[Grand Master Dayin]

30:07.680 --> 30:10.400
You are… Grand Master Dayin?

30:11.350 --> 30:11.960
What?

30:12.830 --> 30:13.630
If I'm not him,

30:15.210 --> 30:15.940
you are?

30:17.830 --> 30:19.290
Not quite what I imagined.

30:22.350 --> 30:23.830
Amitabha.

30:26.400 --> 30:30.310
These days, there's fighting everywhere
on Yunxia Mountain.

30:30.680 --> 30:33.110
Strife in the martial world never ends.

30:34.000 --> 30:35.330
In such a storm of blood,

30:35.440 --> 30:37.160
who will have the last laugh?

30:40.850 --> 30:43.980
Perhaps it's better
to leave your condition untreated.

30:44.450 --> 30:45.130
Sir,

30:46.000 --> 30:47.030
please leave.

30:50.150 --> 30:50.780
Master,

30:51.880 --> 30:52.960
I indeed came here

30:53.880 --> 30:55.550
for meridian treatment.

30:56.240 --> 30:57.880
But the situation is dire now.

30:57.880 --> 31:00.340
Please leave Biechuan Temple immediately.

31:01.160 --> 31:02.830
The forces near Yunxia Mountain

31:02.830 --> 31:04.230
will be coming here soon.

31:11.250 --> 31:12.980
They've been fighting for days

31:13.350 --> 31:14.480
but never came here.

31:14.960 --> 31:17.640
You're just trying to scare me

31:18.000 --> 31:19.110
into treating you.

31:19.640 --> 31:20.920
I won't fall for that.

31:21.300 --> 31:23.460
You two, leave the mountain at once.

31:23.510 --> 31:24.200
Master,

31:24.830 --> 31:26.090
I'm not exaggerating.

31:26.550 --> 31:28.070
The Power Gang
and those from the waterways

31:28.070 --> 31:30.000
are fighting near Yunxia Mountain

31:30.110 --> 31:31.920
over Shao Liulei's Infinite Pill.

31:31.920 --> 31:33.030
Please, Master,

31:33.400 --> 31:34.720
leave Biechuan Temple soon.

31:34.720 --> 31:35.270
Abbot,

31:35.480 --> 31:36.030
bad news.

31:39.030 --> 31:40.350
Abbot, bad news.

31:40.510 --> 31:43.200
There are many venomous snakes
around the temple.

31:43.200 --> 31:44.200
Venomous snakes?

31:44.550 --> 31:46.960
We just spread
snake-repelling powder around the temple.

31:46.960 --> 31:49.020
Where did all those snakes come from?

31:49.550 --> 31:52.210
Someone must be
using snakes to scout this area.

31:52.680 --> 31:53.400
Master,

31:53.760 --> 31:55.920
take your disciples
and leave the temple at once.

31:55.920 --> 31:57.680
Yuhan, we can't stay here long.

31:58.160 --> 31:59.110
Take Grand Master Dayin

31:59.110 --> 32:00.920
to stay at Your Highness's house
for a few days.

32:00.920 --> 32:01.750
What about you?

32:01.750 --> 32:03.460
Your injuries haven't healed.

32:03.460 --> 32:04.430
As you know,

32:05.350 --> 32:06.550
once I make up my mind,

32:07.000 --> 32:08.510
nothing can stop me.

32:08.920 --> 32:10.630
Zhu the Great King
and the Power Gang are coming here

32:10.630 --> 32:11.460
all for this.

32:11.720 --> 32:12.960
It's too dangerous for you to stay alone.

32:12.960 --> 32:14.220
This is my only chance.

32:14.590 --> 32:16.550
This move is dangerous,

32:17.920 --> 32:21.590
but it's the only way
to avenge the Xiao family.

32:23.110 --> 32:24.200
What if you fail?

32:26.420 --> 32:27.420
If I fail,

32:28.840 --> 32:30.300
I'll just call it bad luck.

32:32.790 --> 32:33.480
Boy.

32:35.000 --> 32:36.000
What's your name?

32:38.160 --> 32:39.160
I'm Xiao Qiushui.

32:40.880 --> 32:43.880
The third son
of the Xiao family from the Huanhua Sect?

32:48.480 --> 32:51.280
The Xiao family was
struck by tragedy not long ago.

32:53.000 --> 32:54.920
You must've endured great pain

32:55.160 --> 32:57.160
when your meridians were rejoined.

32:57.830 --> 32:59.030
It was painful,

32:59.030 --> 33:00.560
but I'm still a cripple now.

33:01.830 --> 33:04.090
Compared to the vengeance for my family,

33:05.270 --> 33:06.350
it was nothing.

33:08.960 --> 33:09.790
Qiushui,

33:11.070 --> 33:12.270
you've impressed me.

33:12.750 --> 33:13.590
In the past,

33:13.790 --> 33:16.710
when I used the Heavenly Acupuncture
to repair meridians,

33:16.710 --> 33:19.070
there was only a 50% chance of success.

33:19.750 --> 33:22.480
Today, I'll let you decide

33:23.110 --> 33:24.910
whether to risk your life or not.

33:25.000 --> 33:26.260
Will you take the risk?

33:28.110 --> 33:28.750
Master,

33:29.160 --> 33:30.160
if I can recover,

33:31.510 --> 33:32.440
I, Xiao Qiushui,

33:34.420 --> 33:35.880
will be forever grateful.

33:50.990 --> 33:52.970
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

33:53.000 --> 33:55.500
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

33:55.520 --> 33:59.120
♪ Let the gleam of swords
cut through all dust ♪

33:59.320 --> 34:01.280
♪ Strive for the far shore
at journey's end ♪

34:01.300 --> 34:03.310
♪ Only when the long night
finally comes to an end ♪

34:03.340 --> 34:06.660
♪ Will this bow be not in vain ♪

34:06.750 --> 34:08.870
♪ Let the pouring rain drench me ♪

34:08.900 --> 34:10.610
♪ Let frost and snow embrace me too ♪

34:10.639 --> 34:14.110
♪ My lifelong sword intent
remains unchanged ♪

34:14.130 --> 34:15.860
♪ Through 1,000 years, a million ages ♪

34:15.889 --> 34:17.860
♪ I will still cleave mountains
and carve paths ♪

34:17.889 --> 34:24.790
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

34:28.659 --> 34:30.909
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

34:30.929 --> 34:32.850
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

34:32.880 --> 34:36.110
♪ Let the gleam of swords
cut through all dust ♪

34:36.570 --> 34:38.040
♪ Strive for the far shore
at journey's end ♪

34:38.060 --> 34:40.040
♪ Only when the long night
finally comes to an end ♪

34:40.060 --> 34:43.270
♪ Will this bow be not in vain ♪

34:43.290 --> 34:45.409
♪ Let the pouring rain drench me ♪

34:45.429 --> 34:47.150
♪ Let frost and snow embrace me too ♪

34:47.179 --> 34:50.650
♪ My lifelong sword intent
remains unchanged ♪

34:50.670 --> 34:52.400
♪ Through 1,000 years, a million ages ♪

34:51.110 --> 34:51.840
Big Brother.

34:52.420 --> 34:54.400
♪ I will still cleave mountains
and carve paths ♪

34:53.440 --> 34:53.969
How is it?

34:54.429 --> 35:01.330
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

35:05.190 --> 35:06.250
Thank you, Master.

35:07.590 --> 35:08.230
Young man,

35:08.590 --> 35:09.850
in your current state,

35:09.960 --> 35:12.360
you should hide away for a few years

35:12.480 --> 35:13.540
to slowly recover.

35:14.230 --> 35:15.290
Do you understand?

35:15.840 --> 35:16.840
The martial world

35:18.190 --> 35:19.920
doesn't need one more hermit,

35:20.710 --> 35:21.570
but it could use

35:22.600 --> 35:23.930
one more brave soul.

35:26.830 --> 35:27.620
You brat.

35:28.400 --> 35:29.000
Great.

35:29.400 --> 35:31.260
Then I'll tell you one more thing.

35:31.510 --> 35:33.210
The person you're looking for,
Shao Liulei—

35:33.210 --> 35:34.670
though I've never met him,

35:34.840 --> 35:35.970
there's been crying

35:36.320 --> 35:39.960
from the side hall of the temple
at midnight in the past few days.

35:40.320 --> 35:41.380
It sounds like a cat

35:42.400 --> 35:43.920
or a person weeping.

35:44.320 --> 35:46.270
You might want to check it out.

35:48.770 --> 35:49.330
Alright.

35:49.880 --> 35:50.940
Thank you, Master.

35:51.550 --> 35:52.280
Big Brother,

35:54.070 --> 35:55.530
I'll wait for your return.

35:57.000 --> 35:57.550
Okay.

35:58.590 --> 35:59.590
You take care too.

36:01.480 --> 36:02.920
Amitabha.

36:18.050 --> 36:21.120
[Treasury of the True Dharma Eye]

36:53.840 --> 36:56.500
This guy is
the strangest character in the book.

36:56.960 --> 36:58.820
I remember his internal injuries

36:59.100 --> 37:01.100
have something to do with Crazy Yan.

37:12.390 --> 37:13.830
[Shao Liulei]

37:16.890 --> 37:17.640
Shao Liulei.

37:19.290 --> 37:20.040
Shao Liulei?

37:23.410 --> 37:24.810
Shao Liulei, is that you?

37:29.980 --> 37:30.830
Who are you?

37:31.410 --> 37:32.870
Why are you looking for me?

37:33.440 --> 37:34.110
Mr. Shao,

37:35.640 --> 37:37.640
I'm not the only one looking for you.

37:38.590 --> 37:40.510
Many people are looking for you.

37:46.360 --> 37:49.160
Are you sent by the Power Gang
or Zhu the Great King?

37:49.920 --> 37:50.400
Tell me!

37:54.020 --> 37:57.020
C-Crazy… Crazy Yan.

38:02.150 --> 38:05.960
Crazy Yan, Crazy Yan, Crazy Yan.

38:07.800 --> 38:08.550
Crazy Yan.

38:15.110 --> 38:17.440
What's your relationship with Crazy Yan?

38:22.840 --> 38:23.510
Mr. Shao,

38:24.320 --> 38:26.190
Crazy Yan is my elder brother.

38:30.050 --> 38:30.790
Okay, I see.

38:31.290 --> 38:34.940
The Infinite Pill has the yin part
and the yang part.

38:35.670 --> 38:38.800
Take both together
and you get 60 years' worth of power.

38:39.430 --> 38:40.150
Yeah, yeah.

38:41.760 --> 38:43.560
But my elder brother, Crazy Yan,

38:43.760 --> 38:45.290
only gave you the yang pill.

38:46.030 --> 38:47.560
When you took the yang pill,

38:48.030 --> 38:50.490
the yang energy
exploded through your body,

38:50.960 --> 38:52.760
causing you excruciating pain.

38:54.110 --> 38:55.000
M-Mr. Shao,

38:55.000 --> 38:56.000
please don't cry.

38:57.830 --> 39:00.670
If I can heal your internal injuries,

39:02.550 --> 39:03.800
would you like to try?

39:05.820 --> 39:06.700
Is Mr. Yan here?

39:08.280 --> 39:09.150
Is Mr. Yan here?

39:10.080 --> 39:11.850
If Mr. Yan could come,

39:12.880 --> 39:14.080
no one could stop him.

39:15.190 --> 39:15.710
Right.

39:17.190 --> 39:17.670
Right.

39:30.280 --> 39:31.680
So many people have come.

39:32.670 --> 39:33.480
Who are they?

39:35.670 --> 39:38.150
They're all here looking for you.

39:40.450 --> 39:41.670
Are you mistaken?

39:42.630 --> 39:43.360
Impossible.

39:43.630 --> 39:45.630
Shao Liulei wouldn't hide far away.

39:48.150 --> 39:49.750
We haven't seen the target yet,

39:49.750 --> 39:51.610
but our opponents have caught up.

39:52.850 --> 39:53.880
So annoying.

39:54.320 --> 39:55.280
Wherever we go,

39:55.750 --> 39:57.280
you follow right behind us.

39:57.320 --> 39:59.720
Shao Liulei is one of us
from the waterways.

40:00.590 --> 40:02.590
Li Chenzhou shouldn't be after him.

40:04.670 --> 40:06.190
You haven't found him either.

40:06.190 --> 40:07.590
So why are you on our tail?

40:07.800 --> 40:09.070
We've been at this for days.

40:09.070 --> 40:11.030
All those small skirmishes led us nowhere.

40:11.030 --> 40:13.690
Why don't we settle this
with a real fight today?

40:13.710 --> 40:15.370
You think we're afraid of you?

40:22.760 --> 40:23.760
Everyone's here.

40:26.030 --> 40:26.830
Song Mingzhu,

40:27.630 --> 40:29.090
you came at the right time.

40:29.510 --> 40:30.360
With you here,

40:31.110 --> 40:33.150
those guys won't last long.

40:37.220 --> 40:39.420
Master sent me to find Shao Liulei.

40:42.800 --> 40:44.860
I don't recall him sending any of you.

40:45.070 --> 40:47.330
We're just acting in Chief's interests.

40:49.670 --> 40:50.400
Good.

40:51.700 --> 40:52.570
Go on and fight.

40:53.320 --> 40:54.380
I'll go take a walk.

41:04.660 --> 41:05.630
Come, come.

41:09.880 --> 41:11.030
Why did Mr. Yan

41:11.510 --> 41:12.440
send you to me?

41:13.280 --> 41:15.140
Has Shao Liulei never met Mr. Yan?

41:18.030 --> 41:21.840
He said he's felt bad
about how he's treated you

41:21.890 --> 41:23.000
over the years.

41:23.960 --> 41:26.590
He wants me to teach you

41:26.670 --> 41:29.550
a method to remove
the yang energy from your body.

41:30.000 --> 41:30.760
What method?

41:33.070 --> 41:34.360
What he means is,

41:34.840 --> 41:36.760
if you return the Infinite Pill,

41:37.510 --> 41:39.310
he'll tell you about the method.

41:41.190 --> 41:42.450
I've got it right here.

41:54.540 --> 41:55.590
This pill

41:55.660 --> 41:57.680
had been with Mr. Yan for many years.

41:57.920 --> 41:59.120
He never needed it.

41:59.480 --> 42:01.100
Why does he suddenly want it back

42:01.100 --> 42:01.960
after I took it?

42:08.760 --> 42:09.550
Actually,

42:10.070 --> 42:12.030
my brother doesn't want it for himself.

42:12.030 --> 42:14.920
He and I have reunited,

42:15.550 --> 42:18.360
and he wants to give this pill to me.

42:19.550 --> 42:20.320
To you?

42:23.590 --> 42:24.920
If you don't believe me,

42:25.190 --> 42:26.450
you can check my pulse.

42:26.710 --> 42:29.150
I've lost all my martial arts skills.

42:29.170 --> 42:30.190
No need for that.

42:30.500 --> 42:31.700
I tested you just now.

42:32.550 --> 42:34.350
You have no martial arts skills.

42:36.320 --> 42:37.250
Open your mouth.

42:49.740 --> 42:51.340
So this is the Infinite Pill.

42:51.470 --> 42:52.240
I'll take it.
